  "title": "Homemade Strawberry Crumble",
  "description": "This strawberry crumble recipe has a layer of sweet strawberries topped with oats and walnuts for a crunchy addition to a classic summer dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "Diana Moutsopoulos"
  ],
